@local = http://localhost:5003
@cloud = https://app-clo25-rbac-name.azurewebsites.net


### Local root - is the app running at all
GET {{local}}/

### Local secret check - Locally there is no Key Vault reference, so this answers "present": false
GET {{local}}/secret-check


### Cloud root - is the app running at all
GET {{cloud}}/

### Cloud secret check - did the secret arrive from Key Vault
### Expected: "present": true and "unresolved": false.
### "unresolved": true means App Service passed the reference string through instead.
GET {{cloud}}/secret-check
